 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Not weird at all. Being alone can actually be very peaceful. Fun, in a stress free way. A solo picnic in a quiet spot is very calming. People usually give whatever they feel comfortable. Having few friends with you also raises the average. People like feeling of being in the spotlight. Then have plan ready for when people ask why you' alone. 'This tiny spot is my favourite spot, and I couldn't find friends to come with me.' Keep it short and honest.",
